{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_the_cleanup_contract", "label": "The cleanup contract", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cleanup is the stop half of a start/stop pair. React will call that pair as many times as it needs to."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_indistinguishable_sequence", "label": "setup \u2192 cleanup \u2192 setup must match setup once", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If the screen, network or outside world looks different after the extra cycle, the cleanup is incomplete."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_cleanup_not_unmount", "label": "Cleanup is not unmount code", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It runs on dependency change with old values, on unmount, and once extra under StrictMode. Tied to dependencies, not the component lifetime."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_closes_over_old", "label": "Cleanup closes over the old render", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A cleanup that saw new values would disconnect a room it never connected to. A missing dependency leaves handles never released."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_symmetrical_cleanup", "label": "Symmetrical cleanup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Read setup line by line and name each inverse. Symmetry is about the observable effect: a fetch is undone by ignoring its result."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_ref_guard_antifix", "label": "Ref guard anti-fix", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "hasRun hides the extra cycle but the resource survives unmount. The question is how to survive remounting, not how to run once."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_cleanup_without_setup", "label": "Cleanup without setup is a code smell", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Usually reaching for when this unmounts. Cleanup also runs on every dependency change. If there is no external system, remove the Effect."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_the_cleanup_contract", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_01_what_an_effect_is_for_react_dev_synchronizing_with_effects", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_cleanup_not_unmount", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_01_what_an_effect_is_for_componentdidmount_wrong_model", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_closes_over_old", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_03_the_dependency_array_stale_first_render_closure", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_ref_guard_antifix", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_05_strictmode_double_invocation_extra_setup_cleanup_cycle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_04_cleanup_01_the_cleanup_contract_cleanup_without_setup", "target": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_06_you_might_not_need_an_effect_readme_you_might_not_need_an_effect", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/04-cleanup/01-the-cleanup-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}